abstract: "Emertech Certify is an academic, decentralized credential verification architecture integrating Ethereum smart contracts, deterministic SHA-256 cryptographic digests, IPFS content-addressed storage, and client-side OCR text extraction to eliminate academic credential fraud and provide instantaneous, tamper-evident verification."
